    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`list llListSortStrided(list ListVariable, integer Stride, integer Sortkey, integer Ascending);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p class="deprecated-text"><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>Deprecated:  use table.sort because Prefer structured tables over strided lists.</span></p>
      <p>  <p>llListSortStrided is llListSort with the added parameter of stride_index, adding the flexibility to sort by any item in the stride. These routines use the same underlying code and have the same computational complexity.</p>
  <p>Returns a list that is <b>src</b> sorted by the <b>stride_index</b> item in every <b>stride</b>.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
