          <td>ListVariable / src</td>
          <td>List to be sorted.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>number</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>integer</span></td>
          <td>Stride / stride</td>
          <td>number of entries per stride, if less than 1 it is assumed to be 1</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>number</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>integer</span></td>
          <td>Sortkey / stride_index</td>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>It's 1 based</span>The index within the stride to sort by. stride_index is 0-indexed. The first element is 0, second 1, etc. An index of 0 is functionally identical to using <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlListSort" target="_blank">llListSort</a>. Negative indexes count from the end of the stride, e.g. -1 means the last element in the stride.</td>
        </tr>
